# bonus.rpyc:37
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_af67e96f:

    # Cornelia "Geez. Can you believe the big day’s almost here already?"
    Cornelia "唉，真不敢相信，转眼就到这一天了。"

# bonus.rpyc:39
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_9327b70e:

    # Cornelia "It’s like I’ve been waiting for this moment for ages, but now it’s here, I don’t know what to think about it. It all feels so sudden!"
    Cornelia "明明盼了好久，可真到了眼前，又不知道该是什么心情。总觉得太突然了！"

# bonus.rpyc:41
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_52054ac1:

    # Nienke "You’re telling me."
    Nienke "可不是吗。"

# bonus.rpyc:42
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_a8697c86:

    # "I reply with a brief nod, my arms wound about my legs."
    "我抱着双腿，轻轻点了点头。"

# bonus.rpyc:49
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_8f0c1931:

    # "I’m sitting among the tall grass with Cornelia, side by side."
    "我和科妮莉娅并肩坐在高高的草丛里。"

# bonus.rpyc:50
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_d1427ec6:

    # "The sun has already set, vanishing beneath the horizon, and the sky is a dark bluish-black, studded all over with stars."
    "太阳早已沉入地平线，深蓝近黑的夜空中缀满繁星。"

# bonus.rpyc:51
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_7fa23417:

    # "The moon hangs overhead, a pointed crescent, and the sails of the mills lie still, shining silvery white."
    "一弯尖尖的新月悬在头顶，风车的叶片静止着，泛出银白的光。"

# bonus.rpyc:52
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_e644c964:

    # "There’s a cool breeze which nudges my hair; the hem of my skirt."
    "凉风轻轻拨动我的头发和裙摆。"

# bonus.rpyc:53
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_227c73fa:

    # "I wore my favourite purple dress with the knit cardigan on top. The dress, I bought during a rare excursion to Leiden with Cornelia a few weeks ago, while the cardigan was made by my father."
    "我穿着最喜欢的紫色连衣裙，外面罩了件针织开衫。裙子是几周前难得和科妮莉娅去莱顿时买的，开衫则是爸爸亲手织的。"

# bonus.rpyc:54
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_6f9a116e:

    # "My father likes fiddly, delicate tasks you can do with your hands."
    "爸爸喜欢做那些繁琐又精细的手工活。"

# bonus.rpyc:55
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_f63cb924:

    # "Mostly, he busies himself with his bottled ships, but he’s good at knitting and sewing too: much better than my mother, who used to struggle simply to sew my name tags into my old P.E. kits."
    "平时，他大多忙着摆弄瓶中船，不过织毛衣、做针线也很拿手，比妈妈强多了。以前，光是给我的体育课运动服缝个姓名标签，她都费劲。"

# bonus.rpyc:56
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_5ed74f50:

    # "My father wound up taking over that duty from my mother, though she tried to insist (rather stubbornly, I think) that she ought to be the one to take care of it."
    "最后还是爸爸接过了这份差事，尽管妈妈一再坚持，说这应该由她来做。在我看来，实在有点固执。"

# bonus.rpyc:68
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_68502cf5:

    # Elowen g "{i}This is a mother’s job, Emiel. I’m sure all of the other children in Miss Baum’s class will be relying on their mothers for this sort of thing too.{/i}"
    Elowen g "{i}这本来就是妈妈该做的事，埃米尔。鲍姆老师班上其他孩子的这些事，肯定也都是妈妈在操心。{/i}"

# bonus.rpyc:69
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_3101b706:

    # Elowen g "{i}I don’t want to let Nienke down!{/i}"
    Elowen g "{i}我不想让妮恩克失望！{/i}"

# bonus.rpyc:70
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_d013c399:

    # "My mother got rather caught up on this relatively minor (in my opinion, at least) thing."
    "妈妈对这件小事格外耿耿于怀——至少在我看来，这只是小事。"

# bonus.rpyc:71
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_9da76572:

    # "She seemed to think that her inability to sew in my name tags neatly was proof of her failing not just as a mother, but as an elf."
    "她似乎觉得，连姓名标签都缝不整齐，就说明她不仅不是个合格的母亲，连做精灵都不合格。"

# bonus.rpyc:72
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_b907ac64:

    # "I don’t think I’ve seen her more worked up before. I couldn’t really understand it."
    "我好像从没见她这么激动过，实在不太明白。"

# bonus.rpyc:73
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_5a64541b:

    # "Why was she tormenting herself so much, in the most literal sense (she kept poking herself in the pad of her index finger with the needle), when my father could manage it more quickly and more neatly?"
    "爸爸明明做得更快、更整齐，她为什么还非要这么折磨自己？而且，真的是折磨：她老是拿针扎到食指的指腹。"

# bonus.rpyc:74
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_dc548937:

    # "I asked her why she cared so much, and she said it was about her pride as a mother, whatever that means..."
    "我问她为什么这么在意，她说，这关系到她做母亲的自尊。我也不懂那是什么意思……"

# bonus.rpyc:75
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_7e2fb0fd:

    # "Though she eventually relented when I told her that Cornelia’s mother didn’t sew the labels into her P.E. shirts."
    "不过，后来我告诉她，科妮莉娅体育课衣服上的标签，也不是她妈妈缝的，她终于让步了。"

# bonus.rpyc:76
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_eba90d6c:

    # Nienke "{i}Ceesje’s mother died when she was little, so her dad does all of the chores. That doesn’t mean her mother was a bad mother, though, does it?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}小茜的妈妈在她很小的时候就去世了，所以家务都是她爸爸做的。可这也不代表她妈妈就不是个好妈妈呀，对不对？{/i}"

# bonus.rpyc:77
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_e55431e9:

    # "My childishly innocent remark must have stirred something in my mother, because she finally seemed to see sense."
    "我那句天真的童言，大概触动了妈妈。她终于像是想通了。"

# bonus.rpyc:78
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_c9406546:

    # "She delegated the sewing duties to my father after that, and we’ve not had any further incidents."
    "从那以后，针线活就交给了爸爸，再也没闹过这样的风波。"

# bonus.rpyc:79
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_725d6b95:

    # "My father made this cardigan for my seventeenth birthday, and I’m fond of it. It’s very soft, so it’s perfect to wear on these late night walks that Cornelia and I like to take, and it’s also practical."
    "这件开衫是爸爸送给我的十七岁生日礼物，我很喜欢。它特别柔软，最适合穿着和科妮莉娅一起在深夜散步，而且也很实用。"

# bonus.rpyc:80
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_6a3fab55:

    # "It has pockets, which are very useful, since most of my nicer clothes don’t have any pockets at all. They aren’t that common on women’s clothes for some reason, maybe because it ruins the silhouette of them?"
    "它有口袋，这点特别方便。毕竟，我那些好看的衣服大多没有口袋。不知道为什么，女装上很少有这个，也许是怕破坏衣服的轮廓？"

# bonus.rpyc:81
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_5ec9a410:

    # "Mostly, however, I think it’s annoying."
    "反正，我只觉得很不方便。"

# bonus.rpyc:95
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_b41071a8:

    # "...In any case, my cardigan is doing wonders right now. I bundle myself up into it, shivering, while I look Cornelia up and down."
    "……总之，现在这件开衫可帮了大忙。我把自己裹紧，打着哆嗦，上下打量科妮莉娅。"

# bonus.rpyc:96
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_32116755:

    # "I’m finding it a little hard to believe myself, but..."
    "我自己也有些难以相信，不过……"

# bonus.rpyc:98
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_6a1b289e:

    # Nienke "I’ll... really miss you when you’re gone, Ceesje. Alpenrose won’t be the same without you."
    Nienke "你走了以后，我会……很想你的，小茜。没有你，阿尔彭罗瑟就不一样了。"

# bonus.rpyc:100
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_6c090a75:

    # Nienke "You will write to me, won’t you, when you’re away in Utrecht? You’ll keep in touch?"
    Nienke "去了乌得勒支，你会给我写信的，对吧？我们会一直联系的，对吧？"

# bonus.rpyc:110
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_d833f794:

    # Cornelia "Of course! That should go without saying, silly."
    Cornelia "当然啦！这还用说吗，傻瓜。"

# bonus.rpyc:112
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_6fd7796c:

    # Cornelia "I’ll be sure to write a lot — and they’ll be good letters, too. My father’d probably scold me if I couldn’t fill at least one side of A4 paper, hehe."
    Cornelia "我一定会写好多信，而且每封都写得好好的。要是连一面A4纸都写不满，我爸大概会骂我，嘿嘿。"

# bonus.rpyc:120
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_6b42bc50:

    # "Cornelia’s father, Laurens, has never cared much about Cornelia’s grades in maths or the sciences, but he’s pretty overbearing where the humanities are involved: probably because he’s a writer himself."
    "科妮莉娅的爸爸劳伦斯，从来不太在乎她的数学和理科成绩。可一涉及人文学科，他就管得很严，大概因为他自己就是作家吧。"

# bonus.rpyc:121
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_35cd0d1c:

    # "That was how Laurens was able to keep a shelter over the heads of his two children, Fritz and Cornelia, and how he’s kept them both well-fed and watered."
    "他正是靠写作，才让弗里茨和科妮莉娅两个孩子有屋可住、衣食无忧。"

# bonus.rpyc:122
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_14b53fdf:

    # "Apparently, Laurens’s books are quite popular, though I’m not sure what he writes. He’s very cagey about it."
    "听说，他的书还挺受欢迎。不过，我不知道他写的是什么。他对此守口如瓶。"

# bonus.rpyc:123
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_522720a8:

    # "He has his own study, where he sits hunched up over his typewriter, and he asks that Cornelia knock before she enters."
    "他有自己的书房，平时就弓着背坐在打字机前，还要求科妮莉娅进去前必须敲门。"

# bonus.rpyc:124
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_e96a1286:

    # "Cornelia’s lived with her dad all her life — all eighteen years of it — but not even she’s seen what he writes."
    "科妮莉娅跟他一起生活了整整十八年，却连她都没看过父亲写的东西。"

# bonus.rpyc:125
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_4fe12e7d:

    # "Laurens is a tall, muscular man, but he’s surprisingly domestic, and he keeps his house neat and tidy."
    "劳伦斯高大健壮，却意外地很会料理家务，屋子里总是收拾得干干净净。"

# bonus.rpyc:126
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_70dc88b9:

    # "I’m always a little surprised, actually, by how prim and proper Cornelia’s home is when I visit her."
    "说真的，每次去科妮莉娅家，看到那副整整齐齐的样子，我都难免有点惊讶。"

# bonus.rpyc:127
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_77c0d0f9:

    # "The carpets are always freshly beaten, the kitchen counters scrubbed, the plants freshly watered."
    "地毯总是刚掸过灰，厨房台面擦得锃亮，花草也刚浇过水。"

# bonus.rpyc:128
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_ca885f02:

    # "Laurens has a huge, eclectic collection of books, ranging from children’s fairytales to murder mysteries, but he doesn’t leave them lying around..."
    "劳伦斯的藏书又多又杂，从儿童童话到凶杀推理，什么都有，却从来不会随手乱放……"

# bonus.rpyc:129
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_2d566a75:

    # "And he doesn’t leave his manuscripts lying around, either. He guards them jealously, almost like a dragon."
    "他的手稿也一样。他把那些稿子看得紧紧的，简直像守着宝藏的龙。"

# bonus.rpyc:130
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_1ac97178:

    # "What sort of books her father writes has been a subject of great debate between myself and Cornelia for years."
    "这些年来，他到底写什么书，一直是我和科妮莉娅争论不休的话题。"

# bonus.rpyc:131
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_2408fbc8:

    # "We’ve gone to The Book Nook multiple times, trying to find any titles penned by Laurens Verstappen, but we’ve not had any luck there, either."
    "我们去过好几次书角，想找找劳伦斯·维斯塔潘写的书，却始终一无所获。"

# bonus.rpyc:132
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_7ec5c11c:

    # "I think Laurens must publish his work under a pseudonym."
    "我想，他出版时一定用了笔名。"

# bonus.rpyc:133
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_d6912bbf:

    # "Cornelia theorises that her father must write very smutty, sultry romance stories, which his why he’s so secretive about them."
    "科妮莉娅猜，她爸爸写的肯定是那种香艳露骨的爱情小说，才会这么遮遮掩掩。"

# bonus.rpyc:134
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_ccbde452:

    # "I, meanwhile, think he must write for children, and he’s embarrassed to be associated with princesses and fairies when he’s such a broad, beefy man."
    "我却觉得，他写的应该是儿童故事。毕竟他那么魁梧结实，跟公主、仙子扯上关系，大概会不好意思吧。"

# bonus.rpyc:135
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_56f106a6:

    # "Either way, we’ve never gotten any closer to solving this mystery. Fritz doesn’t know what his father writes either, and he’s never seemed all that interested."
    "不管怎样，这个谜团始终没有解开。弗里茨也不知道父亲写的是什么，而且似乎从来没多大兴趣。"

# bonus.rpyc:136
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_e2e2ffe6:

    # "He cared more about trying to chat up the pretty popular girls at school: Ivonne and Lieke and the others."
    "他更关心怎么去搭讪学校里那些漂亮又受欢迎的女孩，像伊冯娜、莉可，还有其他人。"

# bonus.rpyc:137
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_348f2353:

    # "Cornelia and I vowed that we’d figure out what, exactly, her father writes before the end of this summer, but we weren’t able to make much headway."
    "我和科妮莉娅曾发誓，这个夏天结束前，一定要查出她爸爸到底写的是什么，可始终没什么进展。"

# bonus.rpyc:138
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_16dab38d:

    # "I spent every other day with Cornelia, eating dinner with her and her father (Fritz has already moved out) and sleeping in her bed, and we still have no idea."
    "我隔三岔五就去她家，和她、她爸爸一起吃晚饭——弗里茨已经搬出去了——晚上还睡她的床，可我们依旧毫无头绪。"

# bonus.rpyc:147
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_57d9178e:

    # "Now, it looks like we’ll have to put this little game on hold."
    "现在看来，这个小游戏只能暂时搁置了。"

# bonus.rpyc:148
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_91681547:

    # "Laurens will still be here, tapping away at his typewriter in his study in his neat little house in Alpenrose like always, but Cornelia won’t be there."
    "劳伦斯还会留在阿尔彭罗瑟，在那栋整洁的小屋的书房里，照旧敲着打字机。可科妮莉娅不会留在那里了。"

# bonus.rpyc:150
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_232233e9:

    # "She’ll be going away to Utrecht tomorrow."
    "明天，她就要去乌得勒支。"

# bonus.rpyc:151
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_2118bdfe:

    # "She has her things packed already: all of her favourite clothes, and her stuffed seal, Marsha, and her scrapbooks, and all of her stickers."
    "她已经收拾好了行李：最喜欢的衣服，名叫玛莎的海豹玩偶，剪贴簿，还有所有的贴纸。"

# bonus.rpyc:153
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_577343ea:

    # "I was with her earlier, when she was packing, so I helped her. I folded her clothes, and I stashed her old, well-thumbed children’s books in bags to be tossed out, and I tried to smile all the while."
    "之前她收拾东西时，我就在旁边帮忙。我替她叠好衣服，把那些翻得卷了边的旧童书装进袋子准备扔掉，整个过程都努力保持着笑容。"

# bonus.rpyc:154
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_975a6bdc:

    # "I didn’t want Cornelia to know how much her absence would affect me."
    "我不想让她知道，她的离开会让我多难受。"

# bonus.rpyc:156
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_8aa979a5:

    # "I didn’t want to make her feel guilty about leaving, and I still don’t. I know she isn’t doing this to spite me, but it hurts all the same."
    "我不想让她为离开而内疚，现在也不想。我知道，她不是故意让我难过，可心里还是疼。"

# bonus.rpyc:158
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_0b163227:

    # "I don’t want her to go. She’s my best friend in all the world, and Alpenrose will feel so small and sad without her."
    "我不想让她走。她是我最好的朋友。没有她，阿尔彭罗瑟会变得那么狭小，那么寂寞。"

# bonus.rpyc:159
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_46e4cccf:

    # "I feel pretty sad, too. My eyes are wet with tears, but I don’t want to cry. That would only make Cornelia feel guilty, and that’s the last thing I want."
    "我也很难过。眼泪涌了上来，可我不想哭。那只会让科妮莉娅内疚，而这恰恰是我最不愿看到的。"

# bonus.rpyc:161
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_c8979897:

    # "She isn’t doing anything wrong by going to university. In fact, I’m happy for her."
    "去上大学，她又没有做错什么。其实，我是为她高兴的。"

# bonus.rpyc:162
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_e380ba1a:

    # "I should be happy, at least..."
    "至少，我应该高兴……"

# bonus.rpyc:164
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_c258e891:

    # "So why does it feel like my heart is breaking?"
    "那为什么，心里却像要碎了一样？"

# bonus.rpyc:166
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_a6f2062c:

    # "I sniffle, then dig my fingernails into my palm, hard. I’m hoping the pain will make my tears dry up, but it doesn’t stop them. My irises still feel glassy, and I swallow."
    "我吸了吸鼻子，把指甲狠狠掐进掌心，希望疼痛能把眼泪逼回去。可没有用。眼前依旧水蒙蒙的，我咽了咽口水。"

# bonus.rpyc:167
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_f925a30f:

    # "There’s a lump in my throat. If I have to say more than I already have, I’ll start crying. I don’t want to make a fool out of myself, so I keep quiet."
    "喉咙堵得厉害。再多说一句，我大概就会哭出来。我不想出丑，便一言不发。"

# bonus.rpyc:169
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_573d235c:

    # "What is there to say, anyway?"
    "而且，又有什么好说的呢？"

# bonus.rpyc:171
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_32eb9f9d:

    # "Nothing I could do would keep Cornelia here. I always knew she would move on one day."
    "不管我做什么，都留不住科妮莉娅。我一直都知道，她总有一天会离开。"

# bonus.rpyc:172
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_3e9aab6f:

    # "This is simply how life is. People come into our lives, then they leave. There’s no wrongdoing to be attributed to it, or any blame to dish out."
    "人生就是这样。有人走进我们的生活，又有人离开。这不是什么错事，也没什么人该受责怪。"

# bonus.rpyc:173
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_5652c376:

    # "It’s just the way of the world."
    "世事本来就是如此。"

# bonus.rpyc:174
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_0e1d6bc7:

    # "It’s something I need to accept, and yet..."
    "我得学着接受，可是……"

# bonus.rpyc:186
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_e8982763:

    # Cornelia "Oh, Niene."
    Cornelia "唉，妮妮。"

# bonus.rpyc:191
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_4eabbddd:

    # Cornelia "I don’t know about you, but I’ll miss you a lot. Utrecht is so far away, and I don’t know if I’ll fit in, and what if letters aren’t enough?"
    Cornelia "我不知道你怎么想，但我会很想很想你的。乌得勒支那么远，我也不知道自己能不能适应。要是光写信还不够，怎么办？"

# bonus.rpyc:192
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_f477c0e9:

    # Cornelia "I want to talk to you face to face, like we always have. I want to have sleepovers, and tell one another horror stories, and I still want to know what sort of books my father’s been writing!"
    Cornelia "我想像以前一样，跟你面对面说话。我想一起过夜，给彼此讲鬼故事，还想弄清楚我爸到底写的是什么书！"

# bonus.rpyc:194
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_faf0a2fe:

    # Cornelia "There’s still so much I want to do with you..."
    Cornelia "还有那么多事，我想跟你一起做……"

# bonus.rpyc:196
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_8b0bb4cf:

    # Cornelia "But I guess it’ll have to wait until the summer. I can’t {i}not{/i} go to university: not when I studied so hard for it. My father would be heartbroken if I stayed behind..."
    Cornelia "不过，大概要等到暑假了。我总不能{i}不去{/i}上大学吧，毕竟那么努力才考上。我真留下来，我爸会伤心死的……"

# bonus.rpyc:198
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_744502a6:

    # Cornelia "But I’ll never forget you, Niene. You’ll always be my best friend."
    Cornelia "可我永远都不会忘记你，妮妮。你永远是我最好的朋友。"

# bonus.rpyc:200
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_5d07605b:

    # Nienke "Ceesje..."
    Nienke "小茜……"

# bonus.rpyc:202
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_6194e775:

    # "I swallow once more, the lump in my throat unshifting. If anything, it feels like it’s gotten even bigger."
    "我又咽了咽口水，喉头的哽咽却没有散去，反而像是堵得更厉害了。"

# bonus.rpyc:209
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_0d1c88e1:

    # "My shoulders tremble, and I worry I really might burst into tears. I don’t want my last private conversation with Cornelia to go like this: me, red-eyed and wet-cheeked, sobbing my heart out."
    "肩膀微微颤抖，我担心自己真的会哭出来。我不想让临别前最后一次和科妮莉娅单独谈心，变成我红着眼、湿着脸，哭得泣不成声。"

# bonus.rpyc:210
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_3a689de3:

    # "I’d hate to make her worry..."
    "我不想让她担心……"

# bonus.rpyc:211
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_91a7f572:

    # "So, I force myself to smile."
    "于是，我逼自己露出笑容。"

# bonus.rpyc:212
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_0e58d1c8:

    # "I can cry later, when I’m at home, in my small bedroom with the sloping roof, surrounded by my terrariums."
    "等回家再哭也不迟。在我那间屋顶倾斜的小卧室里，在一只只玻璃生态缸的陪伴下。"

# bonus.rpyc:213
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_db5250fb:

    # "I can cry when I’m curled up in my bed, my face pressed against my pillow, and maybe Engelmund will hop onto the bed and let me stroke him."
    "我可以蜷在床上，把脸埋进枕头里哭。说不定恩格尔蒙德会跳上来，让我摸摸他。"

# bonus.rpyc:214
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_5224e6b5:

    # "Maybe he’ll keep me company."
    "也许，他会陪着我。"

# bonus.rpyc:215
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_f12ff289:

    # "There’ll be plenty of time for tears later..."
    "以后，有的是时间掉眼泪……"

# bonus.rpyc:216
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_f134372b:

    # "But for now, I want to be strong for Cornelia: my best friend in all the world."
    "可现在，为了科妮莉娅，为了我最好的朋友，我想坚强一点。"

# bonus.rpyc:217
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_1b812650:

    # "She defended me from Hendrik back in primary school, though Miss Baum often turned a blind eye to his bullying."
    "小学时，鲍姆老师常常对亨德里克的欺凌视而不见，是她站出来保护了我。"

# bonus.rpyc:218
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_f183862b:

    # "She used to roll her eyes and scoff whenever Ivonne and Lieke and Karin and Anouk would bump into me in the hallways at Stelle Lyceum, or when they would make disparaging remarks about my ears."
    "在斯特勒中学，每当伊冯娜、莉可、卡琳和阿努克在走廊里撞我，或是拿我的耳朵冷嘲热讽，她都会翻着白眼，嗤之以鼻。"

# bonus.rpyc:219
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_0c2eb698:

    # "For years, she’s been my staunchest ally. She’s done more for me than anybody in my life — with the exception, perhaps, of my parents..."
    "这么多年来，她始终坚定地站在我这一边。除了爸妈，也许再没有谁为我做过这么多……"

# bonus.rpyc:230
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_5936d7cf:

    # "So, I want to see her off properly. I think she deserves at least that much."
    "所以，我想好好送她离开。至少这件事，是我该为她做的。"

# bonus.rpyc:231
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_fffbb856:

    # "I smile at her, though my eyes are very wet, and it feels like I’m going to sob at any moment."
    "我对她笑了笑，虽然眼里满是泪水，随时都可能哭出来。"

# bonus.rpyc:238
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_56e215d5:

    # "Then, I reach out."
    "然后，我伸出手。"

# bonus.rpyc:239
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_eac5a33c:

    # "I find Cornelia’s hand, which is resting on her lap, and nudge her little finger with my own."
    "她的手放在膝上，我用自己的小指轻轻碰了碰她的小指。"

# bonus.rpyc:241
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_7ece62f1:

    # "Gently, I twine our digits together and say..."
    "我轻轻勾住她的手指，说……"

# bonus.rpyc:242
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_d12e4d94:

    # Nienke "It’ll be alright, Ceesje. I’ll never forget you, either. It doesn’t matter how far away you go, or what happens."
    Nienke "没事的，小茜。我也永远不会忘记你。不管你去多远的地方，不管发生什么。"

# bonus.rpyc:244
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_0df7c69d:

    # Nienke "I’ll always be your best friend."
    Nienke "我永远都是你最好的朋友。"

# bonus.rpyc:246
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_e88acdd8:

    # Cornelia "Always...?"
    Cornelia "永远……？"

# bonus.rpyc:248
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_c451e522:

    # Nienke "I’d like to think so. Maybe life has different plans for the both of us, and we won’t be able to talk like we are now. We might drift apart..."
    Nienke "我愿意这样相信。也许人生会给我们不同的安排，我们没办法再像现在这样聊天，也许会渐渐疏远……"

# bonus.rpyc:250
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_82e7ec7e:

    # Nienke "But, even if that does happen, I’ll always remember you. You’ll always be my dear friend..."
    Nienke "可就算真的变成那样，我也会一直记得你。你永远都是我珍爱的朋友……"

# bonus.rpyc:252
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_bbb17e22:

    # Nienke "And that’s never going to change."
    Nienke "这一点，绝不会变。"

# bonus.rpyc:256
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_f2837cbb:

    # "I mean it too, as I sit beneath the starry night sky with Cornelia, the breeze tugging at my hair."
    "我是真心的。星空下，我和科妮莉娅坐在一起，微风轻轻牵动我的发丝。"

# bonus.rpyc:257
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_683e4d98:

    # "We can’t remain children forever. Our paths will diverge inevitably, and we’ll have to go our separate ways. She’ll meet new people, and I’m sure I will, too."
    "我们不可能永远都是孩子。总有一天，道路会分岔，我们也得各自前行。她会遇见新的人，我想，我也会。"

# bonus.rpyc:258
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_3d0e4459:

    # "For many years, my world was small. It was comprised of nothing except Alpenrose, and my parents, and Engelmund, and Fleur de Lys, and Cornelia."
    "很多年来，我的世界都很小。只有阿尔彭罗瑟、爸妈、恩格尔蒙德、百合花咖啡馆，还有科妮莉娅。"

# bonus.rpyc:259
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_1a18dab2:

    # "I thought that was all I wanted, but that might have been the child in me speaking."
    "我曾以为，自己想要的就只有这些。可那也许只是心里那个孩子的想法。"

# bonus.rpyc:260
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_53195155:

    # "I can’t remain a little girl forever."
    "我不能永远做个小女孩。"

# bonus.rpyc:261
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_63eda17c:

    # "We’re both growing up: me and Cornelia..."
    "我们都在长大。我是，科妮莉娅也是……"

# bonus.rpyc:262
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_9a3ff268:

    # "But, so long as I remember this promise we shared beneath the stars, I don’t think she’ll ever stop being my friend."
    "不过，只要我记得这个星空下的约定，我想，她就永远是我的朋友。"

# bonus.rpyc:264
translate zh_CN_portable bonus_54d13ac9:

    # "Come what may, I’ll always love her. I don’t think there’s any force in the world that can change that."
    "无论将来怎样，我都会一直爱她。这世上，大概没有什么能改变这一点。"

